The contents of prompts/, agents/ (now roles/<role>/role.md) and plugin/skills/
in this directory were copied on 2026-10-27 from
https://github.com/HigorAlves/orc at commit
9ef37bd3b1a8e11459ae2ab80ba6d3d31cb5f183 (MIT licensed) and then edited here
for factory mode. They are maintained in this repository from now on; the
upstream copies are not tracked.

On 2026-10-28 three more roles (security-reviewer, reply-drafter, code-fixer)
and two more skills (inline-review, receiving-code-review) were copied from the
same repository at its 0.31.0 release and adapted the same way.

Individual skills keep their own upstream attribution in the `metadata.source`
line of their SKILL.md frontmatter where one was present.

The token economy (RFC 0007) is a port of TokenEconomizer,
https://github.com/microsoft/TokenEconomizer at commit
81e32e56bb3c4c1b4c9756b429be91e3960116ca (Apache-2.0 licensed). Its loop guard,
micro-skills, tool pruning and cost rules were ported to TypeScript and
modified.
